**/.circleci
**/.editorconfig
**/.dockerignore
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/node_modules

# Specific patterns to ignore
data-node
meili_data*
librechat*
Dockerfile*
docs

# Host-side runtime data. Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so without these the whole
# tree lands in the image; on prod `backups/` alone is 7.4GB and the layer export
# fills the disk. All four are bind-mounted over their container paths at runtime
# (docker-compose.prod.yml `volumes: !override`), so the image copies are dead
# weight even when the build does succeed.
backups
guide-media
logs
uploads

# Ignore all hidden files
.*
